Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: adwaita-icon-theme, fonts-dejavu-core, librsvg2-common
Description: Notepad++ source code editor - native GTK 3 port (preview)
 Unofficial native Linux build of the Notepad++ source tree using the GTK 3
 backend of Scintilla. This preview provides tabbed editing in two views,
 syntax highlighting for all Notepad++ languages via Lexilla and User Defined
 Languages, Notepad++ colour themes and the Style Configurator, encoding
 detection, the Find / Replace / Find in Files / Mark dialog with Boost
 regex and a search results panel, macros, Run commands, the Shortcut Mapper,
 Preferences, Notepad++ translations, printing, docking panels (Function
 List, Folder as Workspace, Document Map, Project Panels and others),
 sessions with snapshots of
 unsaved documents, recent files, detection of outside file changes, and a
 single-instance mode compatible with Notepad++ switches. Notepad++'s
 shortcuts.xml, stylers.xml, themes and userDefineLang.xml work unchanged.
 .
 Plugins and auto-completion are not yet ported.
